  "2026-09-11T13:01:57.263Z","harness:codex","TDD evidence: five new isolated identity-boundary regressions failed against the baseline and now pass after SDK add/add refusal, multiple-create rejection, and ambiguity detection. GitHub inventory: zero open PRs/issues and zero open Dependabot/code-scanning/secret-scanning alerts. All-status duplicate inventory read all 2736 items without truncation; canonical lineage reused."
  "2026-09-11T13:12:55.187Z","harness:codex","Manual acceptance passed in a disposable Git repository using the built CLI: two independently created same-id branches failed to merge with item_identity_conflict; the receiving item bytes and single-create history remained intact; no receipt was created. Adding a second physical type-path then made CLI get return item_identity_ambiguous with exit 4. The temporary workspace was removed. Dependency audit returned zero known vulnerabilities; required Sentry/telemetry reliability gate passed with zero recent blocking Sentry issues and zero uncoded telemetry failures."
  "2026-09-11T13:26:18.355Z","harness:codex",User-approved cleanup removed exactly the two synthetic pm-collision receipts from the initial failing driver fixture. Hash comparison verified every other receipt file remained unchanged. No real item document or history stream was edited. Driver regression now isolates cwd as well as tracker roots.
  "2026-09-11T13:45:14.748Z","harness:codex","Integrated verification: all 673 test files and 8723 tests pass. Exact source coverage is statements 64265/64265, branches 48935/48935, functions 13350/13350, lines 61566/61566 (100/100/100/100, zero uncovered). ESLint and all three duplicate scans passed; repository static assurance, generated contracts, package boundaries, command grammar, refusal closure, token budgets, tracker-context measurements and gate registry passed. All ten SDK import-cost and six CLI transport-floor checks pass after coverage load settled. Temporary real Git identity acceptance, package-first dogfood, packed npm/npx/Bun/bunx and installed published 2026.9.11 npm/Bun sessions passed. The initial npm tarball install timed out; the normal smoke retried with cache preference and passed. Credential scan and dependency advisory census found zero secrets/vulnerabilities. Hosted review and merge remain pending."
  "2026-09-11T13:45:52.915Z","harness:codex","Final local closeout: graph-composition and record-integrity assurance passed; final TypeScript and focused ESLint passed. Structured closure records implemented and locally verified behavior for review, not a claim of merge or publication."
  "2026-09-11T14:22:30.034Z","harness:codex","PR 1237 CodeRabbit finding accepted: identical create records do not prove shared identity when the ancestor stream is absent. Two SDK/driver regressions failed before the added empty-ancestor guard. The receiving history file remains unchanged on refusal; a create contained in the common ancestor remains accepted."
  "2026-09-11T14:24:30.328Z","harness:codex","Focused review verification passed 32 tests across identity, whole-document conformance and merge safety. Additional positive boundaries preserve one-sided history creation in both fast-forward directions. The complete static and exact coverage gates are rerunning before the next PR push."
  "2026-09-11T14:43:46.398Z","harness:codex","Review round verification passed: complete pnpm quality:static; all 673 files and 8724 tests; exact coverage statements 64264/64264, branches 48937/48937, functions 13349/13349, lines 61565/61565. Refreshed PM-linked tests and disposable real Git/CLI acceptance passed. SDK and history-driver empty-ancestor identity regressions now reject identical creates; independent N-branch document oracle detects a real deterministic description-loss source mutant. Awaiting pushed-head CI and fresh bot review."
  "2026-09-11T14:44:10.270Z","harness:codex","Hosted initial head 813d1fc passed all CI checks and exact DeepScan/CodeFactor analysis with zero new issues. CodeRabbit provided two valid findings, now fixed and verified locally. Sourcery reported exhausted weekly free review capacity; local Greptile reported free_reviews_limit_reached and hosted Greptile has not replied. Quota or silence is not approval. Every available bot artifact is being acknowledged on its actual review surface and edited revisions are checked again."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-11T13:41:56.381Z","harness:codex","Identity must be validated before scalar preference, history fast-forward, or reanchoring. A valid hash chain cannot establish that independently created documents represent one item. Configured entropy limits likelihood; refusal and storage validation preserve identity when collisions still occur."
